/\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-left w-4 h-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m12 19-7-7 7-7\"></path><path d=\"M19 12H5\"></path></svg><span>Back to Home</span></a><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><a href=\"/api/checklist/download\" download=\"Foothills-Google-Maps-Setup-Checklist.pdf\" class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-2 rounded-xl bg-primary text-white text-sm font-semibold shadow hover:bg-primary/90 transition-all\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-download w-4 h-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 15V3\"></path><path d=\"M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4\"></path><path d=\"m7 10 5 5 5-5\"></path></svg><span>Download 1-Page PDF</span></a></div></div><div class=\"max-w-4xl mx-auto bg-white rounded-3xl shadow-xl border border-stone-200 overflow-hidden print:shadow-none print:border-none print:rounded-none\"><div class=\"p-6 sm:p-10 lg:p-12 text-stone-900 font-sans\"><div class=\"bg-[#2D3328] text-white p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-2xl relative overflow-hidden mb-8\"><div class=\"relative z-10 space-y-3\"><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3\"><div class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider bg-secondary/30 text-[#E7EBD8] border border-secondary/40\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-sparkles w-3.5 h-3.5 text-secondary\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M11.017 2.814a1 1 0 0 1 1.966 0l1.051 5.558a2 2 0 0 0 1.594 1.594l5.558 1.051a1 1 0 0 1 0 1.966l-5.558 1.051a2 2 0 0 0-1.594 1.594l-1.051 5.558a1 1 0 0 1-1.966 0l-1.051-5.558a2 2 0 0 0-1.594-1.594l-5.558-1.051a1 1 0 0 1 0-1.966l5.558-1.051a2 2 0 0 0 1.594-1.594z\"></path><path d=\"M20 2v4\"></path><path d=\"M22 4h-4\"></path><circle cx=\"4\" cy=\"20\" r=\"2\"></circle></svg><span>Grow Local Creative • Foothill Action Guide</span></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 print:hidden\"><button class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg bg-white/10 hover:bg-white/20 text-stone-200 text-xs font-medium transition-colors\" title=\"Print this cheatsheet\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-printer w-3.5 h-3.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M6 18H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h16a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v5a2 2 0 0 1-2 2h-2\"></path><path d=\"M6 9V3a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h10a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v6\"></path><rect x=\"6\" y=\"14\" width=\"12\" height=\"8\" rx=\"1\"></rect></svg><span>Print / Save PDF</span></button><a href=\"/api/checklist/download\" download=\"Foothills-Google-Maps-Setup-Checklist.pdf\" class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg bg-secondary text-primary text-xs font-semibold hover:bg-secondary/90 transition-colors\" title=\"Download direct 1-page PDF file\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-download w-3.5 h-3.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 15V3\"></path><path d=\"M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4\"></path><path d=\"m7 10 5 5 5-5\"></path></svg><span>Direct PDF</span></a></div></div><h1 class=\"font-heading text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-white leading-tight\">5-Minute Google Maps Setup Checklist</h1><p class=\"text-stone-300 text-sm sm:text-base max-w-2xl leading-relaxed\">The practical, zero-fluff playbook for Cool, Auburn, Placerville, and Georgetown Divide businesses to outrank competitors on Google Maps.</p></div><div class=\"mt-4 pt-4 border-t border-white/15 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between text-xs text-stone-400 gap-2\"><span>Printable 1-Page Cheatsheet · Instant Local Action</span><span>Updated for 2026 · Sierra Foothills Focus</span></div></div><div class=\"space-y-6\"><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 bg-stone-50/50 p-5 sm:p-6 transition-all hover:border-stone-300 hover:shadow-sm\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 mb-2\"><span class=\"px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-md bg-[#2D3328] text-white text-[11px] font-bold tracking-wider uppercase\">STEP 1</span><h2 class=\"font-heading text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-stone-900\">Fix the Rural Foothill Address Dilemma</h2></div><p class=\"text-xs text-stone-500 mb-4 pl-1\">Avoid instant Google suspensions from P.O. Boxes and protect your home privacy.</p><div class=\"space-y-3 pl-1\"><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3 text-sm text-stone-700 cursor-pointer select-none group\"><button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Toggle task\" class=\"mt-0.5 w-5 h-5 rounded-md border flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 transition-colors border-stone-300 bg-white group-hover:border-secondary\"></button><div class=\"flex-1 space-y-1.5\"><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed \"><strong class=\"text-stone-900 font-semibold\">Never list a P.O. Box or UPS store:</strong> <!-- -->Google uses automated address verification. Listings using P.O. boxes on Hwy 49 get suspended. Use your physical base of operations.</p></div></div><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3 text-sm text-stone-700 cursor-pointer select-none group\"><button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Toggle task\" class=\"mt-0.5 w-5 h-5 rounded-md border flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 transition-colors border-stone-300 bg-white group-hover:border-secondary\"></button><div class=\"flex-1 space-y-1.5\"><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed \"><strong class=\"text-stone-900 font-semibold\">Hide your residential street address:</strong> <!-- -->If you are a mobile trade (electrician, roofer, landscaper, mobile detailer), check &#x27;I deliver goods and services to customers at their location&#x27; and toggle your street address to Hidden.</p></div></div><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3 text-sm text-stone-700 cursor-pointer select-none group\"><button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Toggle task\" class=\"mt-0.5 w-5 h-5 rounded-md border flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 transition-colors border-stone-300 bg-white group-hover:border-secondary\"></button><div class=\"flex-1 space-y-1.5\"><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed \"><strong class=\"text-stone-900 font-semibold\">Explicitly designate local Foothill service areas:</strong> <!-- -->Add targeted towns: Cool (95614), Georgetown (95634), Auburn (95603/95604), Greenwood, Pilot Hill, Coloma, Lotus, Placerville (95667), Meadow Vista, Foresthill. Google ranks you where you explicitly say you work.</p></div></div></div></div><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 bg-stone-50/50 p-5 sm:p-6 transition-all hover:border-stone-300 hover:shadow-sm\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 mb-2\"><span class=\"px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-md bg-[#2D3328] text-white text-[11px] font-bold tracking-wider uppercase\">STEP 2</span><h2 class=\"font-heading text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-stone-900\">Lock In High-Intent Primary &amp; Secondary Categories</h2></div><p class=\"text-xs text-stone-500 mb-4 pl-1\">Over 60% of Google&#x27;s ranking algorithm relies on category precision.</p><div class=\"space-y-3 pl-1\"><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3 text-sm text-stone-700 cursor-pointer select-none group\"><button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Toggle task\" class=\"mt-0.5 w-5 h-5 rounded-md border flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 transition-colors border-stone-300 bg-white group-hover:border-secondary\"></button><div class=\"flex-1 space-y-1.5\"><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed \"><strong class=\"text-stone-900 font-semibold\">Primary Category is make-or-break:</strong> <!-- -->Don&#x27;t use vague terms like &#x27;Service Provider&#x27; or &#x27;Consultant&#x27;. Choose the exact trade searchers type (e.g., &#x27;Electrician&#x27;, &#x27;Barbecue restaurant&#x27;, &#x27;Tree service&#x27;).</p></div></div><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3 text-sm text-stone-700 cursor-pointer select-none group\"><button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Toggle task\" class=\"mt-0.5 w-5 h-5 rounded-md border flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 transition-colors border-stone-300 bg-white group-hover:border-secondary\"></button><div class=\"flex-1 space-y-1.5\"><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed \"><strong class=\"text-stone-900 font-semibold\">Add 3-5 precise secondary categories:</strong> <!-- -->Example: For a bakery/cafe: Primary: &#x27;Bakery&#x27; · Secondary: &#x27;Coffee shop&#x27;, &#x27;Caterer&#x27;, &#x27;Breakfast restaurant&#x27;. Don&#x27;t stuff unrelated categories.</p></div></div><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3 text-sm text-stone-700 cursor-pointer select-none group\"><button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Toggle task\" class=\"mt-0.5 w-5 h-5 rounded-md border flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 transition-colors border-stone-300 bg-white group-hover:border-secondary\"></button><div class=\"flex-1 space-y-1.5\"><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed \"><strong class=\"text-stone-900 font-semibold\">Inspect your top local rival:</strong> <!-- -->Open Google Maps, search your trade in Auburn or Placerville, and look at the gray tag under the top 3 results. Match their primary category.</p></div></div></div></div><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 bg-stone-50/50 p-5 sm:p-6 transition-all hover:border-stone-300 hover:shadow-sm\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 mb-2\"><span class=\"px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-md bg-[#2D3328] text-white text-[11px] font-bold tracking-wider uppercase\">STEP 3</span><h2 class=\"font-heading text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-stone-900\">Upload Real Local Photos (Google Demotes Stock Photos)</h2></div><p class=\"text-xs text-stone-500 mb-4 pl-1\">Locals hire real humans they can trust with their keys and their property.</p><div class=\"space-y-3 pl-1\"><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3 text-sm text-stone-700 cursor-pointer select-none group\"><button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Toggle task\" class=\"mt-0.5 w-5 h-5 rounded-md border flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 transition-colors border-stone-300 bg-white group-hover:border-secondary\"></button><div class=\"flex-1 space-y-1.5\"><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed \"><strong class=\"text-stone-900 font-semibold\">Zero stock photos:</strong> <!-- -->Google computer vision detects stock imagery and lowers profile rank. Real iPhone/Android photos receive 3x higher inquiries.</p></div></div><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3 text-sm text-stone-700 cursor-pointer select-none group\"><button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Toggle task\" class=\"mt-0.5 w-5 h-5 rounded-md border flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 transition-colors border-stone-300 bg-white group-hover:border-secondary\"></button><div class=\"flex-1 space-y-1.5\"><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed \"><strong class=\"text-stone-900 font-semibold\">The Essential 5 Photos:</strong> <!-- -->1) Branded truck/van or storefront sign on Hwy 49, 2) You and your crew smiling, 3) 2-3 recent clean before-and-after jobs or fresh food items.</p></div></div><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3 text-sm text-stone-700 cursor-pointer select-none group\"><button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Toggle task\" class=\"mt-0.5 w-5 h-5 rounded-md border flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 transition-colors border-stone-300 bg-white group-hover:border-secondary\"></button><div class=\"flex-1 space-y-1.5\"><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed \"><strong class=\"text-stone-900 font-semibold\">Natural Foothills GPS geotagging:</strong> <!-- -->Take photos with your phone camera location enabled. Google reads the Foothills metadata automatically, confirming you operate locally.</p></div></div></div></div><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 bg-stone-50/50 p-5 sm:p-6 transition-all hover:border-stone-300 hover:shadow-sm\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 mb-2\"><span class=\"px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-md bg-[#2D3328] text-white text-[11px] font-bold tracking-wider uppercase\">STEP 4</span><h2 class=\"font-heading text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-stone-900\">Create Your Direct 1-Tap Google Review Shortlink</h2></div><p class=\"text-xs text-stone-500 mb-4 pl-1\">Make it effortless for happy customers to leave 5-star feedback in under 30 seconds.</p><div class=\"space-y-3 pl-1\"><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3 text-sm text-stone-700 cursor-pointer select-none group\"><button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Toggle task\" class=\"mt-0.5 w-5 h-5 rounded-md border flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 transition-colors border-stone-300 bg-white group-hover:border-secondary\"></button><div class=\"flex-1 space-y-1.5\"><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed \"><strong class=\"text-stone-900 font-semibold\">Eliminate all friction:</strong> <!-- -->Never say &#x27;Look us up on Google&#x27;. Open your Google Business dashboard -&gt; click &#x27;Ask for reviews&#x27; -&gt; copy your unique shortlink (g.page/r/...).</p></div></div><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3 text-sm text-stone-700 cursor-pointer select-none group\"><button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Toggle task\" class=\"mt-0.5 w-5 h-5 rounded-md border flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 transition-colors border-stone-300 bg-white group-hover:border-secondary\"></button><div class=\"flex-1 space-y-1.5\"><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed \"><strong class=\"text-stone-900 font-semibold\">The 30-Second Text Script:</strong> <!-- -->Send this text immediately after wrapping up a job while the customer is thrilled:</p><div class=\"mt-2 rounded-xl bg-white border border-stone-200 p-3 sm:p-4 text-xs font-mono text-stone-800 space-y-2 relative\"><p class=\"leading-relaxed\">“Hey [Name], thanks for trusting us today! If you have 30 seconds, a quick Google review helps our small Foothills family business immensely: [PASTE_YOUR_LINK]”</p><div class=\"flex justify-end print:hidden\"><button class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-lg bg-stone-100 hover:bg-stone-200 text-stone-700 font-sans text-xs font-medium transition-colors\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-copy w-3 h-3 text-stone-500\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"14\" height=\"14\" x=\"8\" y=\"8\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg><span>Copy Text Script</span></button></div></div></div></div><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3 text-sm text-stone-700 cursor-pointer select-none group\"><button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Toggle task\" class=\"mt-0.5 w-5 h-5 rounded-md border flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 transition-colors border-stone-300 bg-white group-hover:border-secondary\"></button><div class=\"flex-1 space-y-1.5\"><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed \"><strong class=\"text-stone-900 font-semibold\">Local keyword bonus:</strong> <!-- -->When a customer writes &#x27;Best electrician in Cool&#x27; or &#x27;Great Auburn BBQ&#x27;, Google indexes those keywords directly into your local rank.</p></div></div></div></div><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 bg-stone-50/50 p-5 sm:p-6 transition-all hover:border-stone-300 hover:shadow-sm\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 mb-2\"><span class=\"px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-md bg-[#2D3328] text-white text-[11px] font-bold tracking-wider uppercase\">STEP 5</span><h2 class=\"font-heading text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-stone-900\">The 60-Second Friday &#x27;Google Update&#x27; Ranking Trick</h2></div><p class=\"text-xs text-stone-500 mb-4 pl-1\">Active listings crush inactive competitors who haven&#x27;t touched their profile in 6 months.</p><div class=\"space-y-3 pl-1\"><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3 text-sm text-stone-700 cursor-pointer select-none group\"><button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Toggle task\" class=\"mt-0.5 w-5 h-5 rounded-md border flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 transition-colors border-stone-300 bg-white group-hover:border-secondary\"></button><div class=\"flex-1 space-y-1.5\"><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed \"><strong class=\"text-stone-900 font-semibold\">Algorithm preference for active profiles:</strong> <!-- -->Google ranks profiles with recent activity over dormant listings. You only need 60 seconds once a week.</p></div></div><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3 text-sm text-stone-700 cursor-pointer select-none group\"><button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Toggle task\" class=\"mt-0.5 w-5 h-5 rounded-md border flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 transition-colors border-stone-300 bg-white group-hover:border-secondary\"></button><div class=\"flex-1 space-y-1.5\"><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed \"><strong class=\"text-stone-900 font-semibold\">The 2-Sentence Local Formula:</strong> <!-- -->Every Friday, click &#x27;Add update&#x27; -&gt; post 1 photo of what you worked on this week + 2 sentences: &#x27;Wrapping up a custom metal roof installation out in Georgetown before the weekend rain!&#x27;</p></div></div><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3 text-sm text-stone-700 cursor-pointer select-none group\"><button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Toggle task\" class=\"mt-0.5 w-5 h-5 rounded-md border flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 transition-colors border-stone-300 bg-white group-hover:border-secondary\"></button><div class=\"flex-1 space-y-1.5\"><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed \"><strong class=\"text-stone-900 font-semibold\">100% Free SEO:</strong> <!-- -->This consistently feeds Google fresh geotagged local keywords without spending a single dollar on Google Ads.</p></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"mt-8 rounded-2xl bg-[#E8EEE0] border border-[#C4D0A4] p-6 sm:p-7 relative overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-center justify-between gap-6 relative z-10\"><div class=\"space-y-2 max-w-xl\"><div class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-[#2D3328]\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-sparkles w-3.5 h-3.5 text-secondary\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M11.017 2.814a1 1 0 0 1 1.966 0l1.051 5.558a2 2 0 0 0 1.594 1.594l5.558 1.051a1 1 0 0 1 0 1.966l-5.558 1.051a2 2 0 0 0-1.594 1.594l-1.051 5.558a1 1 0 0 1-1.966 0l-1.051-5.558a2 2 0 0 0-1.594-1.594l-5.558-1.051a1 1 0 0 1 0-1.966l5.558-1.051a2 2 0 0 0 1.594-1.594z\"></path><path d=\"M20 2v4\"></path><path d=\"M22 4h-4\"></path><circle cx=\"4\" cy=\"20\" r=\"2\"></circle></svg><span>Grow Local Creative · Cool, CA</span></div><h3 class=\"font-heading text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold text-[#2D3328]\">Want us to audit or optimize your Google Profile and website for you?</h3><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-700 leading-relaxed\">We build fast, clean websites and handle Google Maps rankings for local contractors, restaurants, and shops across Cool, Auburn, Placerville, and Georgetown.</p></div><div class=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row md:flex-col gap-2 shrink-0\"><a href=\"tel:5303346276\" class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 px-4 py-2.5 rounded-xl bg-[#2D3328] text-white text-xs font-semibold shadow hover:bg-stone-800 transition-colors\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-phone w-3.5 h-3.5 text-secondary\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M13.832 16.568a1 1 0 0 0 1.213-.303l.355-.465A2 2 0 0 1 17 15h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v3a2 2 0 0 1-2 2A18 18 0 0 1 2 4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v3a2 2 0 0 1-.8 1.6l-.468.351a1 1 0 0 0-.292 1.233 14 14 0 0 0 6.392 6.384\"></path></svg><span>Call / Text (530) 334-6276</span></a><a href=\"mailto:hello@growlocalcreative.com\" class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 px-4 py-2.5 rounded-xl bg-white text-stone-900 border border-stone-300 text-xs font-medium hover:bg-stone-50 transition-colors\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-mail w-3.5 h-3.5 text-stone-600\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m22 7-8.991 5.727a2 2 0 0 1-2.009 0L2 7\"></path><rect x=\"2\" y=\"4\" width=\"20\" height=\"16\" rx=\"2\"></rect></svg><span>Email Us</span></a></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"max-w-4xl mx-auto mt-6 text-center text-xs text-stone-500 print:hidden\">Grow Local Creative · Cool, CA · Serving El Dorado &amp; Placer Counties</div></div><!--$--><!--/$--><footer class=\"bg-primary text-primary-foreground pt-14 pb-8\"><div class=\"container mx-auto px-4\"><div class=\"mb-14 rounded-3xl bg-primary-foreground/[0.07] border border-primary-foreground/15 p-6 sm:p-8 lg:p-10 shadow-lg relative overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"absolute top-0 right-0 w-72 h-72 bg-secondary/10 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none\"></div><div class=\"relative z-10 grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 items-center\"><div class=\"lg:col-span-7 space-y-3\"><div class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider bg-secondary/20 text-[#E7EBD8] border border-secondary/30\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-file-text w-3.5 h-3.5 text-secondary\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M15 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V7Z\"></path><path d=\"M14 2v4a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h4\"></path><path d=\"M10 9H8\"></path><path d=\"M16 13H8\"></path><path d=\"M16 17H8\"></path></svg><span>Free Local Business Lead Magnet</span></div><h3 class=\"font-heading text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-primary-foreground tracking-tight leading-tight\">Let&#x27;s stay connected.</h3><p class=\"text-primary-foreground/80 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed max-w-xl\">Every once in a while, I share a quick, jargon-free tip to help local businesses and non-profits run smoother online. No spam, ever.</p></div><div class=\"lg:col-span-5\"><form class=\"space-y-3\"><div class=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-2\"><input type=\"email\" data-slot=\"input\" class=\"border-input file:text-foreground focus-visible:border-ring aria-invalid:ring-destructive/20 dark:aria-invalid:ring-destructive/40 flex w-full border px-3 py-1 shadow-xs transition-[color,box-shadow] outline-none file:inline-flex file:h-7 file:border-0 file:bg-transparent file:text-sm file:font-medium disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 aria-invalid:border-destructive h-12 rounded-xl bg-white text-stone-900 placeholder:text-stone-500 border-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-secondary text-sm\" placeholder=\"Enter your email address...\" value=\"\"/><button type=\"submit\" tabindex=\"0\" data-slot=\"button\" class=\"group/button inline-fle